{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489259-3d-printer-gadget","id":489259,"title":"3D Printer Gadget?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-23T04:24:07-07:00","id":489259,"title":"3D Printer Gadget?","content":"I had the thought that one might make a Gadget out of a 3D Printer, but I'm having a hard time isolating a. what I would use, in terms of exploit or embed and b. what would be fair and balanced, so.... thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5670-kalad2","name":"kalad2","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"59"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T07:46:33-07:00","id":489456,"title":"","content":"Cuckoo's Egg.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3855-gebbethine","name":"gebbethine","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3855_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"233"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T11:21:02-07:00","id":489670,"title":"","content":"Authorized, fake id's with the exact details you give them.<br /> Or any other kind of effect you can see broken down to a base component that though similar is not as adaptable in the moment.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-23T15:01:05-07:00","id":489892,"title":"","content":"Well, an Exploit doesn't have to be conceptually related to its hardware, so really anything on that front.<br /> <br /> As far as Embeds go. . .<br /> <br /> Right Tools, Right Job (the printer creates tools with an equipment bonus)<br /> The Map Is Not the Territory (any print job given to the printer comes out horribly mangled)<br /> Voice of the Machine (the printer creates random bits of junk that can be deciphered for hints to the God-Machine's next move)<br /> Special Message (the printer prints out a message when a predesignated individual approaches it)<br /> Heart's Desire (Near Field; whenever someone touches the printer, it creates an object they want badly)<br /> Quick Change (the printer can create full outfits, though this is probably also a Near Field effect)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T03:45:00-07:00","id":498594,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/489259-3d-printer-gadget?p=489892#post489892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Voice of the Machine (the printer creates random bits of junk that can be deciphered for hints to the God-Machine's next move)</div> </div> </div> </div>This makes me think of Hex from Discworld, and how it accesses L-space. Awesome idea.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5544-ancientswordrage","name":"AncientSwordRage","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}